  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Inlet beach is the hottest new place to spend family vacation, and 30A’s newest beach town, located near Rosemary and Seaside beaches. The location places you within minutes of myriad activities for guests of all ages. This is a prime location just 1/2 mile from the Inlet Beach Regional Public Beach Access, the largest public beach access in South Walton County and Camp Helen State Park is across the street, offering pristine beaches, excellent trails that wind through dunes and scrub oak forests, and access to Lake Powell, the largest rare coastal dune lake in the world. Guests are within an easy walk/bike ride/drive to the newly developed 30Avenue- weekend outdoor farmer’s market - get a yummy treat at Donut Hole - shopping plaza and entertainment venue. Walkability to other tourist destinations of Scenic Highway 30A, including the new rooftop bar at The Pointe, is ideal. Come enjoy the hidden gem of Inlet Beach where the locals go!<br><br>This two-story home with WIFI , smart Tv and natural textures features a total of 4 bedrooms and 3 baths, arcade game room, formal dining room, breakfast bar, laundry room, and a fully equipped kitchen that connects to a private deck with BBQ and lounge set. You can easily choose to entertain your family and friends at the beach or a spend a relaxing day in your home away from home. All bathrooms are equipped with essentials that include hair dryers and towels.<br> <br> <br>The upstairs has 3 bedrooms with arcade game room, 2 full bathrooms. One bedroom sleeps a couple nicely on a queen bed. A crib is available to accommodate new parents in this room. The second bedroom is suited for up to 5 children with a twin bunk and a twin/full bunk. The arcade room could sleep up at least 2 adults , master bedroom at the end of the hall has a king size bed, large smart TV, ensuite bath with oversized double vanities and a large shower. It’s a mini resort with your very own natural palm tree!<br> <br>The downstairs has a cozy living area, dining table that can accommodate 8, a breakfast bar for convenience, and a kitchen for cooking lavishly or microwaving and air fryer for leftovers. Plastic plates/cups/utensils are offered for the children or to lighten your load. A highchair and BOB jogging stroller is also available. We have a spacious first floor bedroom with a king bed, walk-in closet, and its own bathroom.<br> <br>The Grande Point provides it’s residence/guests with access to a pool, umbrellas, boogie boards, chairs, and floats. Parking for 3 vehicles is provided in the paved parking pad in front of the home.<br>",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Tran- Quility beach house"
        }
      ],
